#
# Counter-example for math:ChartShape (derived from the min-1 qualified restrictions
# on math:Chart's math:chartDomain, math:coordinateMap, and
# math:targetCoordinateSpace): a math:Chart naming none of its domain, coordinate map,
# or target coordinate space. Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent
# (math:UnderspecifiedChart).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareChart a math:Chart .
